# Keep the Docker build context small and free of secrets.
.git
.github
.husky
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.next
**/.turbo
apps/api/src/generated

# Environment files: secrets are passed to the container at run time, never baked into the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Not needed to build the API
apps/web
docs
*.md
**/*.log
